{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"195a31b4665a9d91","type":"text","text":"被命名的整形常量集合，用来表示状态，类型等","x":66,"y":-514,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"0f7b2a9c3138010a","type":"text","text":"申明枚举(创建一个自定义枚举类型)","x":440,"y":-600,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"cff981279e741a80","type":"text","text":"申明枚举变量(使用申明的自定义枚举类型，创建一个变量)(类似于int的变量)","x":440,"y":-440,"width":250,"height":80},
		{"id":"93d660903015d458","type":"text","text":"基本概念","x":740,"y":-830,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"4359111dc1de4238","type":"text","text":"枚举","x":-245,"y":-514,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"a2d45efdace8eae5","type":"text","text":"自定义枚举类型 变量名=自定义枚举类型.枚举项;\n`E_MonstorType monstorTypr=E_MonstorType.normal;`","x":740,"y":-440,"width":460,"height":80},
		{"id":"c2a1821971bfcd12","type":"text","text":"申明枚举语法\n`enum E_MonstorType`\n`{`\n    `Normal=2,`\n    `Boss=4,`\n    `任意名字=7,`\n`}`\n","x":1038,"y":-900,"width":202,"height":200},
		{"id":"1c9c171ced9eb26f","type":"text","text":"\"`自定义枚举类型 变量==枚举类型.枚举项`\"方便识别变量是什么类型里的什么东西，而不是用数字表示(其实后面就代表整形)","x":-495,"y":-700,"width":365,"height":100},
		{"id":"d868b72af473ff3f","type":"text","text":"使用位置","x":740,"y":-600,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"2e0abb529b6fe77c","type":"text","text":"namespace语块中(常用)","x":1038,"y":-660,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"5299850e6111952e","type":"text","text":"class，struct语块中","x":1038,"y":-600,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"043b75f324c3a5cd","type":"text","text":"不能在函数语句块Main中申明","x":1038,"y":-540,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ee343c621a9beae7","type":"text","text":"其实就是自己定义一个变量类型，后面可以通过定义变量并使用枚举类型来调用枚举中的项来代替直接赋值","x":440,"y":-770,"width":250,"height":119},
		{"id":"f3878bb1e764a256","type":"text","text":"枚举的类型转换","x":440,"y":-280,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"af023294a11901db","type":"text","text":"转int","x":752,"y":-340,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"48bd48140823229c","type":"text","text":"()强转，\n`int i=(int)monstorType;`","x":1038,"y":-340,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"93bb3424ac2a7f76","type":"text","text":"string转枚举，`(E_PlayerType)Enum.Parse(自补)`","x":752,"y":-100,"width":334,"height":60},
		{"id":"f0ce4835a4610b1e","type":"text","text":"转string(打印出来是枚举项的名字)","x":752,"y":-180,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"84d56e0393e9621d","type":"text","text":"`string str=monstorType.ToSting();`","x":1037,"y":-180,"width":343,"height":60},
		{"id":"27d2ae2793f2916a","type":"text","text":"int转枚举？","x":752,"y":-260,"width":250,"height":57},
		{"id":"1c7bec4d999d61bd","type":"text","text":"搭配switch使用(贯穿用在处理逻辑一样的地方)","x":-80,"y":-370,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"866d6c5e7d267969","type":"text","text":"enum后为自定义的枚举==类型==，枚举类型默认为整形变量，枚举中的元素第一个默认为0，后面依次+1，也可以自定义枚举值，默认第n个值为上一个值+1","x":1320,"y":-882,"width":250,"height":165},
		{"id":"dfa35ee819c99545","type":"text","text":"int[] arr1;","x":764,"y":60,"width":250,"height":60},
